                            <comment id="15167055" author="agura" created="Thu, 25 Feb 2016 10:41:00 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Because schema for cache registers during cache start only (see usages of &lt;tt&gt;org.apache.ignite.internal.processors.query.GridQueryProcessor#onCacheStart&lt;/tt&gt;) H2 SQL parser can&apos;t find schema from query (&lt;tt&gt;cache2&lt;/tt&gt; in our case) and fails.&lt;/p&gt;

