                            <comment id="15169936" author="vkulichenko" created="Fri, 26 Feb 2016 22:06:28 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Made the simple fix: catch exception and try to create all client caches that are currently missing.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Running TC.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15170360" author="vkulichenko" created="Sat, 27 Feb 2016 04:30:16 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;TC passed, code reviewed by Alex G.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Merged to master.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
